      "message": "About the usage of adoptShellPermissionIdentity and dropShellPermissionIdentity, I think whether we can refer to other cases, such as \npackages/modules/Bluetooth/service/tests/src/com/android/server/bluetooth/BluetoothServiceBinderTest.java\n\nIn the setup(), BluetoothServiceBinderTest call adoptShellPermissionIdentity for two permissions and in the tearDown() it call dropShellPermissionIdentity().\n\nI think it\u0027s same as this case, so I believe this won\u0027t break more.\n\nPlease help check, thanks.",
